					<!--Air temperature at the equator at noon, K.-->
					<Decimal Name="DayTemperature" Value="294.261" />

					<!--How much colder a pole is than the equator, K. Air carries heat polewards, so a
					thin-aired world keeps more of what each latitude is given.-->
