					<!--Seconds the air takes to answer the sun. What puts the day's peak after noon.-->
					<Decimal Name="AmbientLagSeconds" Value="45" />

					<!--How much colder a kilometre up is, K/km. Derived: g/cp, two thirds for moisture.-->
